{"id":"timonel-tmdb-300507","type":"SERIES","category":"STREAMING","title":"Timonel","overview":"Tras un humillante escándalo familiar que trunca su vida, Teagan, una prometedora deportista de remo, se ve obligada a empezar de cero en un instituto de élite de una pequeña población. Al descubrir que no hay equipo femenino, se convierte en la timonel del caótico equipo masculino para volver al agua. Mientras intenta ganarse al equipo, choca con su arrogante capitán y surge una conexión inesperada con el miembro más infravalorado del grupo.","releaseDate":"2026-09-10","posterUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7QMTxQf6GXYlMI64yNd7lKXiIux.jpg","backdropUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/lmtTtOjsIBxwKD7LsAD5eeyhq1g.jpg","genres":["Drama"],"originalLanguage":"en","spokenLanguages":["English"],"images":[{"url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/lmtTtOjsIBxwKD7LsAD5eeyhq1g.jpg","label":"Escena 01"},{"url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/spNjWujqeOtPztA5nv2IsjjTSyb.jpg","label":"Escena 02"},{"url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/y8OGCsWSDbKbZrYKf2KFQVvPmDN.jpg","label":"Escena 03"},{"url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/gSCQjyY3Fk1uZADPxUp9q12ewSq.jpg","label":"Escena 04"},{"url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/jfeVYEapywqKfF3Tg6yZNRpdC3t.jpg","label":"Escena 05"}],"ratings":{"tmdb":8.142},"availability":{"platforms":["Netflix","Netflix Standard with Ads"],"networks":["Netflix"]},"saga":{"name":"Timonel","items":[{"title":"Temporada 1","year":"2026","posterUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jkPZW1iHNvlI6077NxSxwITa1tj.jpg","rating":6.7,"extra":"8 episodios"}]},"cast":[{"name":"Miku Martineau","role":"Teagan Tao","photoUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/58S1hYHe1TuHgxxaddzCbqxjJNJ.jpg","personTmdbId":2417570,"department":"Acting","episodeCount":8},{"name":"Jessica Paré","role":"Ella Emerson-Tao","photoUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/udvHIbFPW646vDkbnipb82wPUxs.jpg","personTmdbId":82096,"department":"Acting","episodeCount":8},{"name":"Samuel Braun","ro